    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n49907" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ūrīna</span></b> , ae,
			f.
		kindr. with Sanscr. vāri, water; Gr. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὖρον</span>; cf. urna and urceus,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>urine.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>, <i><span class="en">Cic. Fat. 3, 5</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Cels. 2,
			7</span></i>; <i><span class="en">2, 19</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">Plin.
				24, 11, 56, § 94</span></i>; <i><span class="en">24, 6, 17, §
			27</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Juv. 6, 313</span></i>.—<i>Plur.</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 24, 13, 71, § 115</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">Suet. Aug. 80 <i>fin.</i></span></i>; <i><span class="en">id. Ner. 56</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id.
				Vesp. 23</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Gell. 19, 4, 3</span></i> et
			saep.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">genitalis,</span>”
				<i>seed</i>, <i>semen</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					8, 43, 68, § 168</span></i>
			; cf.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">urina concepta,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Juv.
					11, 170</span></i>
			.—<i>Plur.</i>,
				<i><span class="en">Veg. Vet. 3, 15, 19</span></i>.</div>
